0,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The current chaos is unsustainable. We need a system that prevents social friction.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about fairness. Do the same spots always go to the same doors?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The morning shoving match is the real problem. Location determines bike condition.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Before we argue about spots, let's ask what this mess actually costs us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Agreed. But more than cost, I need to know who maintains the system.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, financial data helps, but I need to see the human impact of past rules.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I want to check the complaint log to see if resentment is justified.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I will observe the morning departures to map the actual physical bottlenecks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll pull the ledger and the treasurer’s file to verify the cash flow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will review the minutes and the sticker register to track administrative lapses.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if the physical layout forces conflict, no rule can fix it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, true. But if the rules are opaque, people feel cheated regardless of layout.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,The rain exposure also matters. Wet bikes are a daily reality for some.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If the building is bleeding money, we can’t afford fancy solutions.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"If the paperwork is too heavy, the system dies in six months.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,We need to balance fairness with social stability. Let’s look at the data.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I hope we find a way to make everyone feel heard and treated equally.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the physical reality. The ground truth is in the morning rush.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will focus on the numbers. The truth is in the bank account.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will focus on the process. The truth is in who does the work.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
