30,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The logs show complaints die because no one owns the problem. We need clear accountability.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The sticker register shows people value their specific spots. They’d rather pay than be equal.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I watched the morning rush. Four times, someone had to move a bike to get theirs out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ledger is empty. We have no reserve. Any new system must be free to run.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The minutes show the last two roles lapsed because no one wanted the paperwork.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if moving bikes is the norm, a rigid allocation will just create new enemies.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, but if we let them keep their spots, the new residents feel like outsiders.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The rain makes the back row miserable. People fight for the dry spots for a reason.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we charge for spots, we need a treasurer. We don't have one.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we assign a manager, they will quit. The burden must be shared or minimal.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,A system that requires constant policing will fail. We need something self-enforcing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"I want a system that feels fair, even if it’s not perfectly equal.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The physical friction is real. We can’t ignore the rain or the shoving.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The financial friction is also real. We can’t afford to hire anyone to manage this.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The administrative friction is the killer. If it’s too hard, it stops.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We need a solution that minimizes the need for human intervention.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Yumi,,And one that minimizes the feeling of being treated unfairly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,And one that accounts for the physical reality of the space.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,And one that costs nothing to maintain.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,And one that doesn’t require a dedicated person to keep it alive.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
